&\Leftrightarrow \left(\frac{1}{1 - \frac{1}{n^2}}\right)^n > \frac{n+1}{n}
\end{align*}
由 Bernoulli 不等式：\(\left(\frac{1}{1-p}\right)^n > (1+p)^n \geq 1 + np\)（取 \(p = \frac{1}{n^2}\)），
\[
\left(\frac{1}{1 - \frac{1}{n^2}}\right)^n > \left(1 + \frac{1}{n^2}\right)^n \geq 1 + \frac{n}{n^2} = 1 + \frac{1}{n}
\]
\end{proof}

