\section{一、双曲函数}

\subsection{1. 定义与几何}

三角函数来自单位圆 \(x^2 + y^2 = 1\)，双曲函数来自单位双曲线 \(x^2 - y^2 = 1\)：
\[
\cosh t = \frac{e^t + e^{-t}}{2} \;(\text{偶}),\qquad
\sinh t = \frac{e^t - e^{-t}}{2} \;(\text{奇}),\qquad
\tanh t = \frac{\sinh t}{\cosh t}
\]

\textbf{与三角函数对比：}\(e^{i\theta} = \cos\theta + i\sin\theta\)，\(\cos\theta = \frac{e^{i\theta}+e^{-i\theta}}{2}\)，\(\sin\theta = \frac{e^{i\theta}-e^{-i\theta}}{2i}\)。

\subsection{2. 恒等式}

\[
\begin{aligned}
\cosh^2 t - \sinh^2 t &= 1 &
1 - \tanh^2 t &= \frac{1}{\cosh^2 t} \\
\sinh(2t) &= 2\sinh t\cosh t &
\cosh(2t) &= \cosh^2 t + \sinh^2 t \\
\cosh(x+y) &= \cosh x\cosh y + \sinh x\sinh y
\end{aligned}
\]

\subsection{3. 微积分}

\[
(\sinh t)' = \cosh t,\quad (\cosh t)' = \sinh t,\quad (\tanh t)' = \frac{1}{\cosh^2 t}
\]
\[
\int \sinh t\,dt = \cosh t + C,\qquad \int \cosh t\,dt = \sinh t + C
\]

\subsection{4. 反双曲函数}

\[
\begin{aligned}
\operatorname{arsinh}\,x &= \ln(x + \sqrt{x^2+1}), &
(\operatorname{arsinh}\,x)' &= \frac{1}{\sqrt{x^2+1}} \\
\operatorname{arcosh}\,x &= \ln(x + \sqrt{x^2-1})\;(x \geq 1), &
(\operatorname{arcosh}\,x)' &= \frac{1}{\sqrt{x^2-1}} \\
\operatorname{artanh}\,x &= \frac12\ln\frac{1+x}{1-x}\;(|x|<1), &
(\operatorname{artanh}\,x)' &= \frac{1}{1-x^2}
\end{aligned}
\]

\section{二、双曲代换求积分}

处理 \(\sqrt{x^2 \pm a^2}\) 时可用双曲代换代替三角代换：

\begin{example}
\begin{enumerate}
\item \(\int \frac{dx}{x^2\sqrt{x^2+1}}\)：令 \(x = \sinh t\)，\(= \int \frac{\cosh t\,dt}{\sinh^2 t\cosh t} = -\frac{1}{\tanh t} + C = -\frac{\sqrt{1+x^2}}{x} + C\)。

\item \(\int \frac{dx}{x\sqrt{x^2+1}}\)：令 \(x = \sinh t\)，\(= -\ln\frac{1+\sqrt{1+x^2}}{x} + C\)。

\item \(\int \frac{\sqrt{x^2-a^2}}{x}\,dx\)（\(x \geq a\)）：令 \(x = a\cosh t\)，\(= \sqrt{x^2-a^2} - a\arctan\frac{\sqrt{x^2-a^2}}{a} + C\)。
\end{enumerate}
\end{example}

