Taylor 展开：\(f(a+h)-f(a) = f'(a)h + \frac12 f''(a)h^2 + o(h^2)\)。

\(f'(a+\theta h) = f'(a) + f''(a)\theta h + o(h)\)。

代入得 \(f'(a)h + \frac12 f''(a)h^2 = f'(a)h + f''(a)\theta h^2 + o(h^2)\)。

\(\therefore f''(a)(\theta - \frac12) + \frac{o(h^2)}{h^2} = 0\)，令 \(h \to 0\) 得 \(\theta \to \frac12\)。
